# Manually acquired source PDFs, verified source manifests, and generated local AAR indices.
# (covered by data/ above, called out here for clarity)

# Frozen snapshot of the derived model tables. The raw pulls stay ignored --
# they are re-fetchable from pinned public URLs -- but the OpenFEMA query is
# not date-pinned, so these three are the only reproducibility record for the
# scores in project/logs/final_summary.log. Loaders prefer a local .csv and
# fall back to these.
!project/data/
project/data/*
!project/data/processed/
project/data/processed/*
!project/data/processed/*.csv.gz
